{"id":1422,"title":"递归类比","summary":"Analogy Of Recursion","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8b1d7742-6f3b-3132-938e-18a8caa1481e","knowledge_id":34,"title":"递归类比","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":34,"title":"递归类比","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"10bb9c6f-fc80-34a0-a952-edb7d1cd6999","title":"","title_html":"","text":"让我们看一个实际例子，了解递归是如何执行的。\n\n假设你正在排队，有几个人排在你前面。","text_html":"<p>让我们看一个实际例子，了解递归是如何执行的。</p>\n<p>假设你正在排队，有几个人排在你前面。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c89cde11-3ebd-3796-91e0-2efa7ed3d7ec","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/269508893097015fceea.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":245,"size_in_bytes":8223,"name":"recursion-3.3.1.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"13d93625-7f9e-3afd-9f2f-e4dd84c97fe7","title":"","title_html":"","text":"如果你想知道自己在当前的位置。你现在唯一掌握的信息就是你的位置是排在你前面的人的位置 (**D**) + 1。","text_html":"<p>如果你想知道自己在当前的位置。你现在唯一掌握的信息就是你的位置是排在你前面的人的位置 (<strong>D</strong>) + 1。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f367dae5-8256-3c3c-8fb5-726ec66475b5","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/a51d77901956cf1ccc1a.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":251,"size_in_bytes":8447,"name":"recursion-3.3.2.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"723c4786-71b7-3fe8-a09d-9e3105905c56","title":"","title_html":"","text":"因此，你必须询问**D**，他的位置是什么。","text_html":"<p>因此，你必须询问<strong>D</strong>，他的位置是什么。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f4083aa8-3659-3ad0-9c48-d902b706d6df","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/ddff562b9405686a48a9.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":263,"size_in_bytes":8339,"name":"recursion-3.3.3.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"97dc5f6a-1747-38a0-892d-49af53a59830","title":"","title_html":"","text":"就像你一样，你前面的人也不知道自己的位置。因此，他们会问前面的人。这个过程一直持续到第一个人（**A**）的位置被问到为止。由于在**A**前面已经没有人了，所以**A**的位置是**1**。","text_html":"<p>就像你一样，你前面的人也不知道自己的位置。因此，他们会问前面的人。这个过程一直持续到第一个人（<strong>A</strong>）的位置被问到为止。由于在<strong>A</strong>前面已经没有人了，所以<strong>A</strong>的位置是<strong>1</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d8c53692-0729-3218-a61b-ef059f65e031","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/a0c4cbae1475b9f429c8.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":263,"size_in_bytes":11596,"name":"recursion-3.3.4.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":7},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d1ab097d-9f13-34b7-8235-880938420643","title":"","title_html":"","text":"现在，**A** 将其位置返回给 **B**。然后，**B** 在 **A** 的位置上加上 **1**，并将其返回给 **C**。","text_html":"<p>现在，<strong>A</strong> 将其位置返回给 <strong>B</strong>。然后，<strong>B</strong> 在 <strong>A</strong> 的位置上加上 <strong>1</strong>，并将其返回给 <strong>C</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":8},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"42c56f57-7b35-3c89-995e-d29b683567a9","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/ef58ed5bc17eb14649e2.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":266,"size_in_bytes":16153,"name":"recursion-3.3.5.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":9},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ac5fa3da-86dc-3e59-b890-1bc3612d195e","title":"","title_html":"","text":"如你所见，当 **D** 返回其位置时，我们只需将 **1** 添加到 **D** 中，就能最终知道我们的位置。\n\n上面的过程其实演示了一个递归的过程。在递归中，我们将问题分解为更小的问题，直到我们遇到终止条件为止。\n\n总而言之，我们在编写递归程序时需要关注两件事:\n\n**1. 在每次递归调用中，我们能做的最少的工作是什么？**\n\n在这里，我们要做的最少的工作就是询问前面的人他们的位置是什么，然后加上**1**。\n\n**2. 递归应该何时停止？(终止条件）**\n\n终止条件是递归的停止条件。最前面的**A**不需要执行任何操作就能知道自己的位置。因此，**A** 只需返回 **1** 作为位置。\n\n递归调用可以在到达第一个人时停止。因此，这里的终止条件是当问题到达第一个人时。\n\n因此，在每一步中，我们都会将**问题缩小一点，直到不能再缩小为止**，也就是直到我们遇到终止条件为止。\n\n然后，在每一步中，终止条件都会返回值，直到我们的问题得到解决。\n\n这是一个非常简单的例子，演示了递归在编程中的作用。","text_html":"<p>如你所见，当 <strong>D</strong> 返回其位置时，我们只需将 <strong>1</strong> 添加到 <strong>D</strong> 中，就能最终知道我们的位置。</p>\n<p>上面的过程其实演示了一个递归的过程。在递归中，我们将问题分解为更小的问题，直到我们遇到终止条件为止。</p>\n<p>总而言之，我们在编写递归程序时需要关注两件事:</p>\n<p><strong>1. 在每次递归调用中，我们能做的最少的工作是什么？</strong></p>\n<p>在这里，我们要做的最少的工作就是询问前面的人他们的位置是什么，然后加上<strong>1</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 递归应该何时停止？(终止条件）</strong></p>\n<p>终止条件是递归的停止条件。最前面的<strong>A</strong>不需要执行任何操作就能知道自己的位置。因此，<strong>A</strong> 只需返回 <strong>1</strong> 作为位置。</p>\n<p>递归调用可以在到达第一个人时停止。因此，这里的终止条件是当问题到达第一个人时。</p>\n<p>因此，在每一步中，我们都会将<strong>问题缩小一点，直到不能再缩小为止</strong>，也就是直到我们遇到终止条件为止。</p>\n<p>然后，在每一步中，终止条件都会返回值，直到我们的问题得到解决。</p>\n<p>这是一个非常简单的例子，演示了递归在编程中的作用。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":10}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0bddecbe-91b2-3477-a677-9d607e24b65b","knowledge_id":35,"title":"自然数1到n之和","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":35,"title":"自然数1到n之和","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"368cca77-adf8-31ab-86b2-2b32871f0850","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在本例中，我们将编写一个程序，使用递归求自然数1到n之和。","text_html":"<p>在本例中，我们将编写一个程序，使用递归求自然数1到n之和。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"368cb676-3dd3-38dc-902f-f5eb9f947873","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"# 自然数1到n之和\ntotal = 1 + 2 + ... + n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b68a642f-8666-394c-afb9-9863d5333b34","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在 **函数**一章中，我们已经编写了一个求数字之和的程序。不过，这次我们将编写一个递归函数，而不是普通函数。\n\n正常计算前`n`个自然数之和的方法是从**1**到 `n`的自然数相加:","text_html":"<p>在 <strong>函数</strong>一章中，我们已经编写了一个求数字之和的程序。不过，这次我们将编写一个递归函数，而不是普通函数。</p>\n<p>正常计算前<code>n</code>个自然数之和的方法是从<strong>1</strong>到 <code>n</code>的自然数相加:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"95c0d9cd-15d6-3b39-8e82-7349b0c312c7","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"1 + 2 + . . .  + n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"31f4b200-67f8-3dff-a9b1-e5a4ff894c16","title":"","title_html":"","text":"等价于下面的方法:","text_html":"<p>等价于下面的方法:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5c24abd6-5720-3386-90b6-8fdd998b73f9","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"1 + 2 + . . . + (n - 1) + n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fa022ebe-c01e-3f76-9c00-2e7ecb6b5094","title":"","title_html":"","text":"因此，可以说 `n` 个自然数的和是前`n-1`个自然数的和加上`n`。\n\n假设函数`calculate_sum(n)` 返回前`n`个自然数的和。那么，我们可以说:\n```text\ncalculate_sum(n) = calculate_sum(n - 1) + n\n```","text_html":"<p>因此，可以说 <code>n</code> 个自然数的和是前<code>n-1</code>个自然数的和加上<code>n</code>。</p>\n<p>假设函数<code>calculate_sum(n)</code> 返回前<code>n</code>个自然数的和。那么，我们可以说:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">calculate_sum(n) = calculate_sum(n - 1) + n\n</code></pre>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"2dd9945d-181e-3f62-b85e-43b5ff816ff4","knowledge_id":36,"title":"递归思考过程","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":36,"title":"递归思考过程","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"37528578-447f-3291-83fe-6450e9c86271","title":"","title_html":"","text":"现在，让我们试着把求自然数之和与之前的递归类比联系起来。在编写递归函数时，必须考虑两件事：\n\n**1. 每次递归调用时，我们能做的最少工作？**\n\n在这里，我们将考虑达到基值时所需的最少工作量。\n\n在递归类比中，我们询问了前面的人的位置。然后，加上**1**，就知道了我们的位置。\n\n我们也可以做类似的事情，先得到 `n - 1` 个自然数的和，然后再加上 `n`，就得到了 `1~n` 的自然数的和。\n然后，`n - 1` 将得到 `n - 1- 1`的和，并将 `n - 1` 加上。这个过程将一直持续到我们找到终止条件为止。\n\n因此，这里最少的工作是将 `n` 加到 `n - 1` 的和上。\n\n**2. 递归函数应该何时停止？(终止条件）**\n\n终止条件的思考非常简单。只要想一个不需要执行任何操作的数字。例如，前**1**个自然数的和是**1**。\n因此，如果数字是**1**。那么，它的和也将是**1**。","text_html":"<p>现在，让我们试着把求自然数之和与之前的递归类比联系起来。在编写递归函数时，必须考虑两件事：</p>\n<p><strong>1. 每次递归调用时，我们能做的最少工作？</strong></p>\n<p>在这里，我们将考虑达到基值时所需的最少工作量。</p>\n<p>在递归类比中，我们询问了前面的人的位置。然后，加上<strong>1</strong>，就知道了我们的位置。</p>\n<p>我们也可以做类似的事情，先得到 <code>n - 1</code> 个自然数的和，然后再加上 <code>n</code> 个数，就得到了 <code>n</code> 个数的和。\n然后，<code>n - 1</code> 将得到 <code>n - 1- 1</code>的和，并将 <code>n - 1</code> 加上。这个过程将一直持续到我们找到终止条件为止。</p>\n<p>因此，这里最少的工作是将 <code>n</code> 加到 <code>n - 1</code> 的和上。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 递归函数应该何时停止？(终止条件）</strong></p>\n<p>终止条件的思考非常简单。只要想一个不需要执行任何操作的数字。例如，前<strong>1</strong>个自然数的和是<strong>1</strong>。\n因此，如果数字是<strong>1</strong>。那么，它的和也将是<strong>1</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"417e011c-f7a0-35fc-bfcd-c4975cb38656","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"if num == 1:\n  return 1","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"958c1975-7bb2-3eca-8941-024fa38d7984","title":"","title_html":"","text":"有了这些信息，我们来看看代码是什么样的。","text_html":"<p>有了这些信息，我们来看看代码是什么样的。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ba642b4c-f837-340b-a11b-faa5b295a84d","knowledge_id":37,"title":"自然数之和递归","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":3,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":37,"title":"自然数之和递归","knowledges":[{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6bd8ce84-c0d1-32b2-bf28-b465bc04ff8c","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def calculate_sum(num):\n\n    # 终止条件\n    if num == 1:\n        return 1\n\n    # 递归调用\n    # 每次调用要执行的最少工作量\n    return num + calculate_sum(num - 1)\n    \n\nresult = calculate_sum(4)\nprint(result)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ab7cc684-cad4-3ade-8762-e090d8e343cf","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**输出**\n\n```text\n10\n```\n\n函数如下图，调用自身，并正确终止返回:","text_html":"<p><strong>输出</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">10\n</code></pre>\n<p>函数如下图，调用自身，并正确终止返回:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"09773140-1e2d-3312-850a-55cc79878224","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/be56eb052e47bc757269.png","style":"original","caption":"Sum of Natural number using recursion","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":1005,"size_in_bytes":75535,"name":"recursion-3.3.6.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"090466c2-f570-36f0-919d-ec880e90615f","knowledge_id":38,"title":"自然数1到n之和","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":4,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":38,"title":"自然数1到n之和","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0156ea53-6be5-3714-b810-52b9d1931753","title":"","title_html":"","text":"让我们看看上一节中的代码是如何运行的。","text_html":"<p>让我们看看上一节中的代码是如何运行的。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"20e08be2-7302-32ec-90a9-d4b79e6ff7dc","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/e23b0f2c2491c0db7117.png","style":"original","caption":"Working of sum of natural numbers","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":338,"size_in_bytes":22756,"name":"recursion-3.3.7.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"Note","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0ba91cfa-febf-3bef-b673-7c87d6bceba7","text":"请注意，在每次函数调用中都传递了不同的值。","text_html":"<p>请注意，在每次函数调用中都传递了不同的值。</p>"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0aa3ed6d-f329-3c89-92cd-fdfce9f951f2","title":"","title_html":"","text":"当 `n` 的值为 **1** 时，将返回 **1** 给函数调用。 即`calculate_sum(1) = 1` \n\n所以在最后一次递归时:","text_html":"<p>当 <code>n</code> 的值为 <strong>1</strong> 时，将返回 <strong>1</strong> 给函数调用。 即<code>calculate_sum(1) = 1</code></p>\n<p>所以在最后一次递归时:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f3c3259f-10c3-36bf-9769-a371c33050a6","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"2 + calculate_sum(2 - 1)\n= 2 + calculate_sum(1)\n= 2 + 1\n= 3","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ab89c450-39c6-33c9-a234-e4cd3ea7b18a","title":"","title_html":"","text":"- `2 + calculate_sum(2 - 1)`的值 **3** 返回到之前的函数调用\n- `2 + calculate_sum(2 - 1)` 从调用栈中移除（弹出）。\n\n让我们看看它在调用栈中是如何实现的。","text_html":"<ul>\n<li><code>2 + calculate_sum(2 - 1)</code>的值 <strong>3</strong> 返回到之前的函数调用</li>\n<li><code>2 + calculate_sum(2 - 1)</code> 从调用栈中移除（弹出）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>让我们看看它在调用栈中是如何实现的。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"926c368c-fe28-33d1-a827-4813fa33f141","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/f5670ca970a4af60b6df.png","style":"original","caption":"Working of sum of natural numbers","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":578,"size_in_bytes":37725,"name":"recursion-3.3.8.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"228a3bc6-aac5-3280-9dc0-4510213449f4","title":"","title_html":"","text":"最后，当我们返回到 `calculate_sum(4)`时，则返回 **10** 到原始函数调用，并从调用栈中跳出。","text_html":"<p>最后，当我们返回到 <code>calculate_sum(4)</code>时，则返回 <strong>10</strong> 到原始函数调用，并从调用栈中跳出。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":7}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b4a12bc8-2dc6-3de0-8e8d-7a3ba1c6ae76","knowledge_id":39,"title":"例2：自然数之和","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":5,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":39,"title":"例2：自然数之和","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"45a30b4d-a30a-3f70-8a7c-df15dc0d6d97","title":"","title_html":"","text":"现在，让我们编写一个程序，用不同的终止条件求自然数1到n之和。\n\n### 示例代码","text_html":"<p>现在，让我们编写一个程序，用不同的终止条件求自然数1到n之和。</p>\n<h2>示例代码</h2>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9e24a922-1ca1-35e8-b56b-4f7f56ccbded","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def calculate_sum(num):\n\n    # 终止条件\n    if num == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    # 递归调用\n    return num + calculate_sum(num - 1)\n    \n\nresult = calculate_sum(5)\nprint(result)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7328eae9-0576-3e4c-ac35-1f53e239110d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**输出**\n\n```text\n15\n```\n\n\n正如你所看到的，我们也可以为同一个程序编写不同的终止条件。\n\n我们用不同的方法展示了同类示例，这样你就会明白解决同一问题有多种方法。","text_html":"<p><strong>输出</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">10\n</code></pre>\n<p>正如你所看到的，我们也可以为同一个程序编写不同的终止条件。</p>\n<p>我们用不同的方法展示了同类示例，这样你就会明白解决同一问题有多种方法。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"ChallengeRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"48c89914-a9e6-3c3c-8096-14b364f4888f","title":"递归求一个数的阶乘","challenge_id":836,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":6,"resolved":{"challenge_id":836,"title":"递归求一个数的阶乘","difficulty":"Easy","points":10,"success_ratio":"45.2%","problem_statement_md":"编写一个程序，使用递归求一个数的阶乘。\n\n**步骤1**\n\n- 定义函数`calculate_factorial()`，接受一个参数`num`。\n- 用递归的方式求`num`的阶乘。\n\n**步骤2**\n\n- 输入一个正整数，，并存储在变量`number`中。。\n- 以`number`为参数，调用`calculate_factorial()`函数并将结果存储在`result`变量中。\n- 打印`result`。","problem_statement_en_md":"## Problem Description\n\nCreate a program to find the factorial of a number using recursion.\n\n**Step 1**\n\n- Create a function named `calculate_factorial()` that accepts an argument `num`.\n- Find the factorial of `num` in a recursive manner.\n\n**Step 2**\n\n- Take a positive integer input from the user.\n- Call `calculate_factorial()` function and store it in the `result` variable.\n- Print `result`.\n\nSee the code outline for hints.\n\n### Example\n\n**input**\n```text\n5\n```\n\n**output**\n```text\n120\n```","input_format_md":"","output_format_md":"","constraints_md":"","hint_md":"","code_templates":[{"id":2076,"language":"python3","template":"# 用你的代码替换 ___\n\n# 定义函数\ndef calculate_factorial(num):\n\n    # 创建递归的停止条件\n    # 提示：想一个不需要任何计算的数\n    # 例如：0的阶乘是1\n    # 如果 num 是 0 返回 1\n    ___\n    ___\n\n\n    # 创建一个递归条件，这将帮助我们在每一步中获取 num 的阶乘\n    # 想一个最小的工作量\n    # 这将执行直到达到基本情况\n    return num * ___\n\n# 从用户那里获取输入\nnumber = int(input())\n\n# 调用 calculate_factorial 函数并将结果存储在 result 变量中\nresult = ___\n\n# 打印结果\nprint(result)","template_head":"","template_tail":"","solution_code":"# 定义函数\ndef calculate_factorial(num):\n\n    # 创建递归的停止条件\n    # 提示：想一个不需要任何操作的数\n    #       例如：0的阶乘是1\n    # 如果 num 是 0 返回 1\n    if num == 0:\n\n        # 返回 1        \n        return 1\n\n\n    # 创建一个递归条件，这将帮助我们在每一步中获取 num 的阶乘\n    # 想一个最小的工作量\n    # 这将执行直到达到基本情况\n    return num * calculate_factorial(num - 1)\n\n# 从用户那里获取输入\nnumber = int(input())\n\n# 调用 calculate_factorial 函数并将结果存储在 result 变量中\nresult = calculate_factorial(number)\n\n# 打印结果\nprint(result)","prepend_code":"","append_code":"","file_name":"","judge_mode":"testcase","unittest_codes":[],"additional_files":[]}],"testcases":[{"id":2291,"case_no":1,"stdin":"5","expected_output":"120","explanation":"","sample":true,"additional":false}],"user_data":null}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"bcb03d51-f819-3bad-9d48-8c61f7fc6dec","title":"猜测输出","question_id":3146,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":7,"resolved":{"question_id":3146,"title":"猜测输出","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"下面程序的输出结果是什么？\n\n```python\ndef calculate_factorial(num):\n  if num == 1:\n    return 0\n\n  return num * calculate_factorial(num - 1)\n\nresult = calculate_factorial(3)\nprint(result)\n```","question_text_html":"<p>下面程序的输出结果是什么？</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python3\">def calculate_factorial(num):\n  if num == 1:\n    return 0\n\n  return num * calculate_factorial(num - 1)\n\nresult = calculate_factorial(3)\nprint(result)\n</code></pre>\n","question_options":[{"id":11009,"key":"A","text":"3\n2\n6","text_html":"<p>3\n2\n6</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"我们在函数中不打印任何内容，因此只有一个输出。","md_html":"<p>我们在函数中不打印任何内容，因此只有一个输出。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11010,"key":"B","text":"0","text_html":"<p>0</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"由于任何数乘以**0**的结果都是**0**，因此输出结果为**0**。","md_html":"<p>由于任何数乘以<strong>0</strong>的结果都是<strong>0</strong>，因此输出结果为<strong>0</strong>。</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11011,"key":"C","text":"6","text_html":"<p>6</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"上述程序在遇到基本情况时返回**0**。任何乘以**0**的结果都是**0**。","md_html":"<p>上述程序在遇到基本情况时返回<strong>0</strong>。任何乘以<strong>0</strong>的结果都是<strong>0</strong>。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11012,"key":"D","text":"其他选项都是错误的","text_html":"<p>其他选项都是错误的</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"答案中有一个是正确的。","md_html":"<p>答案中有一个是正确的。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"918cbb62-0225-323b-9458-eb84e30bfce2","knowledge_id":40,"title":"反向字符串","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":8,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":40,"title":"反向字符串","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8fd1e5a6-c449-31fd-8234-7be0493c9953","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在本例中，我们将编写一个程序来反转字符串。\n\n假设字符串为`\"Vibe\"`，则反转后的字符串为`\"ebiV\"`。\n\n一种快速的方法，使用字符串索引切片，如下:","text_html":"<p>在本例中，我们将编写一个程序来反转字符串。</p>\n<p>假设字符串为<code>&quot;Vibe&quot;</code>，则反转后的字符串为<code>&quot;ebiV&quot;</code>。</p>\n<p>一种快速的方法，使用字符串索引切片，如下:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"771471ef-38e5-3374-8124-7a921fe12dbc","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"text=\"Vibe\"\nprint(text[::-1])","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0686b475-521d-3872-9e0e-454b3153d16c","title":"","title_html":"","text":"现在，让我们来看看如何递归实现字符串反转。","text_html":"<p>现在，让我们来看看如何递归实现字符串反转。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"900da6fa-9533-3235-892f-3097bd47b3b8","knowledge_id":41,"title":"递归过程","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":9,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":41,"title":"递归过程","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b5feb4b0-60ca-3164-bcc7-df1e6542ed3f","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**1. 在每次递归调用中，我们能做的最少的工作是什么？**\n\n我们可以得到 `\"ibe\"` 的反转字符，然后将 `\"V\"` 连接起来，得到 `\"Vibe\"` 的反转字符。\n\n然后 `ibe` 将得到 `be` 的反转字符，并将 `i` 连接到它。这个过程将一直持续到找到目标反转字符串为止。\n\n因此，将 `V` 连接到 `ibe` 的反转字符上，工作量最少。\n\n**2.递归函数应该何时停止？(终止条件）**\n\n与我们在自然数1到n之和中所做的类似。想一想，如果字符串是空的，那么它的反转字符就是一个空字符，即 `\"\"`。","text_html":"<p><strong>1. 在每次递归调用中，我们能做的最少的工作是什么？</strong></p>\n<p>我们可以得到 <code>&quot;ibe&quot;</code> 的反转字符，然后将 <code>&quot;V&quot;</code> 连接起来，得到 <code>&quot;Vibe&quot;</code> 的反转字符。</p>\n<p>然后 <code>ibe</code> 将得到 <code>be</code> 的反转字符，并将 <code>i</code> 连接到它。这个过程将一直持续到找到目标反转字符串为止。</p>\n<p>因此，将 <code>V</code> 连接到 <code>ibe</code> 的反转字符上，工作量最少。</p>\n<p><strong>2.递归函数应该何时停止？(终止条件）</strong></p>\n<p>与我们在自然数1到n之和中所做的类似。想一想，如果字符串是空的，那么它的反转字符就是一个空字符，即 <code>&quot;&quot;</code>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6d0548b2-a9ce-3891-889a-4094f255876a","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"if text == '':\n    return ''","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"09ce0573-dcc3-34f5-9ce9-2464281e7d3d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"有了这些信息，我们来看看代码是什么样的。","text_html":"<p>有了这些信息，我们来看看代码是什么样的。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"76f614a3-3415-3051-828b-5a86b3d2a6ef","knowledge_id":42,"title":"反转递归代码","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":10,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":42,"title":"反转递归代码","knowledges":[{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"565ed772-2fae-3af8-852f-a93a6acc3779","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def reverse(text):\n\n    # 终止条件\n    if text == '':\n        return ''\n    \n    # 递归调用\n    return reverse(text[1:]) + text[0]\n\nresult = reverse('Vibe')\nprint(result)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c7445a6c-3c0e-3e95-ab7c-1a9a4a9f0add","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**输出**\n\n```text\nebiV\n```\n\n在上面的例子中：\n\n- `text[1:]` - 返回从索引 **1 开始的字符***\n- `text[0]` - 返回索引 **0 的字符***","text_html":"<p><strong>输出</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">ebiV\n</code></pre>\n<p>在上面的例子中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>text[1:]</code> - 返回从索引 <strong>1 开始的字符</strong>*</li>\n<li><code>text[0]</code> - 返回索引 <strong>0 的字符</strong>*</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f77771db-9093-38e4-b755-eef129ef56db","knowledge_id":43,"title":"反转字符串实现原理","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":11,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":43,"title":"反转字符串实现原理","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ff5fcd16-3ce9-37f5-86ed-43e271bb63ee","title":"","title_html":"","text":"现在，让我们看看它是如何实现的：","text_html":"<p>现在，让我们看看它是如何实现的：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a8095d10-d3b3-3b28-a955-04145b4386ad","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/973493a406a4ebbc959c.png","style":"original","caption":"Working of reverse string","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":649,"size_in_bytes":32711,"name":"recursion-3.3.9.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"42f6c6e8-777b-38e6-8584-d2c4ed3bbfed","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在每次递归调用中，都会从字符串中删除第一个元素，并将其连接到字符串的末尾。  \n\n当字符串中不再有字符或字符串为空时，就会遇到终止条件。","text_html":"<p>在每次递归调用中，都会从字符串中删除第一个元素，并将其连接到字符串的末尾。</p>\n<p>当字符串中不再有字符或字符串为空时，就会遇到终止条件。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5cf9ee5c-e904-35e9-bd5d-d7c929e588ef","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"reverse('') = ''","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9611ed7b-978c-3ccf-b3bc-1bfc0d7fae3d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"所以","text_html":"<p>所以</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a3d329a2-cd9d-3a3d-afa6-5c12562e4a2e","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"reverse() + 'e'\n= '' + e\n= e","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7c951515-1693-33cc-909e-4d9231b5d9b5","title":"","title_html":"","text":"- `reverse() + 'e'` - 字符串 `'e'` 返回到之前的函数调用\n- `reverse() + 'e'` 从调用栈中移除（弹出）。\n\n让我们看看它在调用栈中是如何实现的。","text_html":"<ul>\n<li><code>reverse() + &#x27;e&#x27;</code> - 字符串 <code>&#x27;e&#x27;</code> 返回到之前的函数调用</li>\n<li><code>reverse() + &#x27;e&#x27;</code> 从调用栈中移除（弹出）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>让我们看看它在调用栈中是如何实现的。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"07f76b89-5570-385a-8f77-0e94f367a58c","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/388736ae8caaa614362d.png","style":"original","caption":"Working of reverse string","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":626,"size_in_bytes":43074,"name":"recursion-3.3.10.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":7},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f9530720-3b1e-39e6-82db-5b30d15038bf","title":"","title_html":"","text":"最后，当我们到达 `reverse('Vibe')` 时，它会返回 `'ebiV'` 到原始函数调用，并从调用栈中跳出。","text_html":"<p>最后，当我们到达 <code>reverse(&#x27;Vibe&#x27;)</code> 时，它会返回 <code>&#x27;ebiV&#x27;</code> 到原始函数调用，并从调用栈中跳出。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":8}]}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"97470eb2-565e-36ac-8e2c-0fdca0d4e7bf","title":"猜测数值","question_id":3147,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":12,"resolved":{"question_id":3147,"title":"猜测数值","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"在第一次递归调用中，函数将传递什么值？\n\n```python\ndef fun(text):\n    \n    return fun(text[1:])\n\nresult = fun('Pro')\nprint(result)\n```","question_text_html":"<p>在第一次递归调用中，函数将传递什么值？</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python3\">def fun(text):\n    \n    return fun(text[1:])\n\nresult = fun(&#x27;Pro&#x27;)\nprint(result)\n</code></pre>\n","question_options":[{"id":11013,"key":"A","text":"Pro","text_html":"<p>Pro</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"由于传递的是字符串\"Pro\"，但在递归调用时不会传递整个文本。","md_html":"<p>由于传递的是字符串&quot;Pro&quot;，但在递归调用时不会传递整个文本。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11014,"key":"B","text":"P","text_html":"<p>P</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"只删除了第一个字符。","md_html":"<p>只删除了第一个字符。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11015,"key":"C","text":"ro","text_html":"<p>ro</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"我们只删除了第一个字符。","md_html":"<p>我们只删除了第一个字符。</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11016,"key":"D","text":"其他选项均是错误的","text_html":"<p>其他选项均是错误的</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"上述答案中有一个是正确的","md_html":"<p>上述答案中有一个是正确的</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"026","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/026/page/1422"}
